"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The password of your %(site_name)s account has just been reset."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_reset_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Votre mot de passe a été réinitialisé"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Your password was reset"

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_set_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Un mot de passe vient d'être défini pour votre compte %(site_name)s."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"A password has just been set for your %(site_name)s account."

#: apps/accounts/templates/account/email/password_set_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Un mot de passe a été défini pour votre compte"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] A password was set for your account"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/mfa_reset_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"À votre demande, l'équipe %(site_name)s a réinitialisé la double "
"authentification de votre compte (%(timestamp)s). Activez-la de nouveau "
"depuis la page « Sécurité » de votre compte ; un rôle de gestion l'exige.\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, prévenez les organisateurs "
"sans attendre."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"At your request, the %(site_name)s team reset the two-factor authentication "
"of your account (%(timestamp)s). Enable it again from the “Security” page of "
"your account; management roles require it.\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this request, let the organisers know right away."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/mfa_reset_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Double authentification réinitialisée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Two-factor authentication reset"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/recovery_codes_generated_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"De nouveaux codes de secours pour la double authentification ont été générés "
"sur votre compte %(site_name)s. Les anciens codes ne sont plus valables."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"New two-factor authentication recovery codes were generated for your "
"%(site_name)s account. The previous codes are no longer valid."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/recovery_codes_generated_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Nouveaux codes de secours"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] New recovery codes"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_activated_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"La double authentification (application TOTP) vient d'être activée sur votre "
"compte %(site_name)s. Conservez vos codes de secours en lieu sûr."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Two-factor authentication (TOTP app) has just been enabled on your "
"%(site_name)s account. Keep your recovery codes somewhere safe."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_activated_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Double authentification activée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Two-factor authentication enabled"

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_deactivated_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"La double authentification (application TOTP) vient d'être désactivée sur "
"votre compte %(site_name)s. Si votre compte a un rôle de gestion, vous "
"devrez la réactiver pour accéder à l'espace de gestion."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Two-factor authentication (TOTP app) has just been disabled on your "
"%(site_name)s account. If your account has a management role, you will need "
"to enable it again to access the management area."

#: apps/accounts/templates/mfa/email/totp_deactivated_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Double authentification désactivée"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Two-factor authentication disabled"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_link_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Une personne connectée à %(site_name)s demande à rattacher cette adresse à "
"son compte pour accepter une invitation à l'édition %(edition_code)s. Si "
"c'est vous, ouvrez ce lien depuis le même compte, dans l'heure :\n"
"\n"
"%(link_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Si vous n'êtes pas à l'origine de cette demande, ignorez ce message : "
"l'adresse ne sera pas rattachée."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"Someone signed in to %(site_name)s asks to link this address to their "
"account to accept an invitation to edition %(edition_code)s. If this is you, "
"open this link from the same account within the hour:\n"
"\n"
"%(link_url)s\n"
"\n"
"If you did not make this request, ignore this message: the address will not "
"be linked."

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_link_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Confirmez l'ajout de cette adresse à votre compte"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Confirm adding this address to your account"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"%(inviter_name)s vous invite à rejoindre l'édition « %(edition_title)s "
"» (%(edition_code)s) de %(site_name)s avec le rôle : %(role_label)s."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"%(inviter_name)s invites you to join the edition "
"“%(edition_title)s” (%(edition_code)s) of %(site_name)s with the role: "
"%(role_label)s."

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_message.txt:5
msgid "Message de l'invitant :"
msgstr "Message from the inviter:"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_message.txt:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Pour accepter ou refuser, ouvrez ce lien (valable jusqu'au "
"%(expires_on)s) :\n"
"\n"
"%(invite_url)s\n"
"\n"
"Pour accepter, connectez-vous avec un compte qui porte cette adresse, ou "
"créez-en un. Si vous ne connaissez pas l'expéditeur, ignorez ce message."
msgstr ""
"To accept or decline, open this link (valid until %(expires_on)s):\n"
"\n"
"%(invite_url)s\n"
"\n"
"To accept, sign in with an account that holds this address, or create one. "
"If you do not know the sender, ignore this message."

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/invitation_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Invitation à rejoindre une édition"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] Invitation to join an edition"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/role_granted_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Le rôle « %(role_label)s » vous a été attribué pour l'édition « "
"%(edition_title)s » (%(edition_code)s). Si vous ne vous y attendiez pas, "
"prévenez les organisateurs."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The role “%(role_label)s” was granted to you for the edition "
"“%(edition_title)s” (%(edition_code)s). If you did not expect this, let the "
"organisers know."

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/role_granted_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Un rôle vous a été attribué"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] A role was granted to you"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/role_revoked_message.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Bonjour,\n"
"\n"
"Le rôle « %(role_label)s » vous a été retiré pour l'édition « "
"%(edition_title)s » (%(edition_code)s)."
msgstr ""
"Hello,\n"
"\n"
"The role “%(role_label)s” was revoked for the edition "
"“%(edition_title)s” (%(edition_code)s)."

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/role_revoked_message.txt:4
#, python-format
msgid "Motif : %(reason)s"
msgstr "Reason: %(reason)s"

#: apps/accounts/templates/role/email/role_revoked_subject.txt:1
#, python-format
msgid "[%(site_name)s] Un rôle vous a été retiré"
msgstr "[%(site_name)s] A role was revoked"

